abstract: >-
  A physics-inspired language modeling architecture that replaces probabilistic token sampling and Transformers with continuous non-linear differential equations (Kuramoto oscillators), enhanced by a Phase-Symbolic Hybrid bridge for exact mathematical and structural code generation.
